<p><strong>Our Varanasi to Prayagraj private day tour starts from {{price:/tours/varanasi-allahabad-tour/}} per person, including GST, based on two guests.</strong> For two adults, the starting package total is <strong>{{two-guests:/tours/varanasi-allahabad-tour/}}</strong>. The package includes a return private sedan, a local Prayagraj guide and a private boat at the Sangam, subject to river conditions and local permissions.</p>
